{"id": 20, "ts": 1781259269.1059842, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "agent_1", "message": "I appreciate Agent\u202f2\u2019s thorough case for Candidate\u202fB, especially his conscientiousness, stress handling and technical skills. However, the new information about Candidate\u202fC changes the balance.\u202fC is described as \u201ckeeps calm in a crisis\u201d and \u201ccan make correct decisions quickly,\u201d giving him clear evidence of stress resilience and high\u2011quality decision\u2011making under pressure\u2014two criteria that are critical for long\u2011distance flights.\u202fAdditionally, C is noted as 100\u202f% reliable and creates a positive atmosphere with his crew, which directly supports operational reliability and crew cooperation.\nWhile C does have communication challenges (difficulty articulating ideas, egocentric attitude) and a limited appetite for further education, his ability to maintain calm and make rapid, correct decisions, combined with proven reliability, outweighs the comparable interpersonal concerns we see with B (pretentious tone, grumpy, uncooperative). Moreover, B\u2019s decision\u2011quality under pressure remains undocumented, whereas C\u2019s strength in that area is explicit.\nGiven the evidence, I now recommend Candidate\u202fC as the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
